<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-PROFITS BY BUSINESS AREA FOR MODO.</title>
<headline>TABLE-PROFITS BY BUSINESS AREA FOR MODO.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry company MoDo reported its results for the first six months of the year, including the following profit and sales by business area.</p>
<p>OPERATING RESULT</p>
<p> Millions of crowns	    1997	1996</p>
<p> MoDo Paper			 204	 256</p>
<p> Holmen Paper		     588	 955</p>
<p> Iggesund Paperboard	    291	 303</p>
<p> MoDo Merchants		    32	  33</p>
<p> Iggesund Timber		   29	  31 LOSS</p>
<p> MoDo Skog			  267	 129</p>
<p> TOTAL			    1,025     1,892</p>
<p>NET SALES</p>
<p>Millions of crowns</p>
<p> MoDo Paper		     3,580     3,622</p>
<p> Holmen Paper		   3,384     3,433</p>
<p> Iggesund Paperboard	  2,030     1,970</p>
<p> MoDo Merchants		 1,771     1,855</p>
<p> Iggesund Timber		  432	 378</p>
<p> MoDo Skog			2,285     2,279</p>
<p> Internal deliveries	 -2,481    -2,650</p>
<p> TOTAL			   11,001    10,887</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
</text>
